      "widgets_values": [
        "## Loop workflow (FL2VA)\n\nOne LoadImage feeds **both** `first_frame` and `last_frame` on `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo`, so the clip starts and ends on the same frame and loops cleanly.\n\n**Model required**\n`ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n\n**Notes**\n- Duration snaps to the 17k+5 frame grid at 24fps. Match the seconds written in the prompt header to the real output length.\n- Start at 5s / 20 steps.\n- Write a motion that returns to its starting pose (breathing, swaying, smoke), not a one-way action."
